  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> </span> has released the notification for the post of <strong>Computer Operator</strong>&nbsp;in the <strong>Department of Uttar Pradesh Chakbandi Vibhag</strong>. This recruitment has been issued for <strong>07</strong> posts. The online application process for UP Chakbandi Vibhag Computer Operator Recruitment 2026 has started on <strong>25 August 2026</strong>, and candidates can apply till <strong>02 September 2026</strong>. Candidates must check the complete details for UP Chakbandi Vibhag Computer Operator Recruitment 2026, which are given below.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">UP Rojgar Sangam (Sewayojan) Portal</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UP Chakbandi Vibhag Computer Operator Recruitment 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">UP Chakbandi Vibhag Outsourcing Recruitment 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>25 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>02 September 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 al